{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve been bailed out of jail, but now you owe a debt that won\u2019t wait. In this <strong>Crime Simulator DEMO</strong>, test your skills on the <strong>first map</strong>, featuring <strong>five houses</strong> full of loot, break-in opportunities, and risky jobs like destruction or planting stolen goods. The full game will feature <strong>three maps</strong>, each harder than the last.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>solo or with up to 4 friends</strong> (full game supports 4-player co-op).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use <strong>lockpicks, crowbars, baseball bats, and sleeping gas</strong> to complete your jobs. The full version will introduce <strong>drones, zip ties, scanners, and more advanced tools</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find <strong>skill magazines</strong> to unlock useful perks, and customize your <strong>hideout with furniture</strong> that grants bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple -\u00a0<strong>pay back your debt before time runs out</strong>. If you fail, you start over, losing your loot and tools but keeping your <strong>skills and hideout upgrades</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Try the <strong>Crime Simulator DEMO</strong> and prove you\u2019re the ultimate thief.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922150?t=1742810381","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742810381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922150/da84cc573e42640129e2f72073c9e75454d41c0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742810381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922150/da84cc573e42640129e2f72073c9e75454d41c0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742810381